ae, Y. bercovieri, Y. frederiksenii </italic>and '<italic>Y. ruckeri </italic>' strains</article-title><source>Int J Antimicrob Agents</source><year>2005</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>496</fpage><lpage>500</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15890500</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ijantimicag.2004.08.020</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B16"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Mammeri</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Poirel</surname><given-names>L</given-names></name><name><surname>Nazik</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nordmann</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Cloning and functional characterization of the ambler class C &#x003b2;-lactamase of <italic>Yersinia ruckeri</italic></article-title><source>FEMS Microbiol Lett</source><year>2006</year><volume>257</volume><fpage>57</fpage><lpage>62</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">16553832</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.1574-6968.2006.00148.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B17"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Tzelepi</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Arvanitidou</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Mavroidi</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Tsakris</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Antibiotic susceptibilities of <italic>Yersinia enterocolitica </italic>and <italic>Y. intermedia </italic>isolates from aquatic environments</article-title><source>J Med Microbiol</source><year>1999</year><volume>48</volume><fpage>157</fpage><lpage>160</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9989643</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B18"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Ahmedy</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Vidon</surname><giv